	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  [Résolu] Comment extraire des champ d'un type record]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=14621#p14621"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Une solution rapide serait de faire ceci :</p><p>SELECT * FROM (select &quot;POUET&quot;(&quot;IDREJET&quot;) from &quot;ADH_REJET&quot; where &quot;DTREJ&quot; = &#039;2012-06-26&#039;) tmp;</p><p>Ou, à partir de la 8.4 :</p><p>WITH tmp AS (select &quot;POUET&quot;(&quot;IDREJET&quot;) from &quot;ADH_REJET&quot; where &quot;DTREJ&quot; = &#039;2012-06-26&#039;)<br />SELECT * FROM tmp;</p>]]></content>
